  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Climate Justice for Debt Justice</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Christian Aid will partner with Power Shift Africa to organise a dinner dialogue on water governance and Africa&apos;s Debt and Climate Agenda. It will also identify concrete options on adaptation finance, debt, risk-sharing and public&#x2013;private investment to strengthen Africa&#x2019;s bargaining power with IFIs, climate funds and bilateral partners, and develop shared near- and long-term continental strategies following the AU Summit</narrative>
  </description>
